#-------------
POGOSTICK ZOMBIE
#-------------
Biomes 	      	 - N/A
Spawn Conditions - N/A
Rarity           - 7.5/10 (10/10 is SUPER RARE)
Tag              - Raid Zombie
#-------------
MOUNTED STATS
#-------------
HP 		 - 30
DMG		 - 2.5/3/4
RNG		 - 2 + 1
SPE		 - 2.5
#-------------
QUIRKS
#-------------
Loses Pogostick to Magnet Shroom. Weakness!
Jumps automatically every .5 seconds, if able.
Only attacks players and flags, ignores plants.
Aggros to the flag.
2.2 blocks tall. Think Wither Skeletons!
#-------------
ABILITIES
#-------------
Gets a Jump Boost when it gets within 20 blocks of the flag.
Gains +1 Jump Boost (up to Lv6, yes, Lv6) every 3 seconds while within this radius.
Loses -1 Jump Boost every 1 second while outside of this radius.
Loses ALL Jump Boost when next to the flag (so it can hit it easier).
#-------------
DISMOUNTED STATS
#-------------
HP 		 - 30
DMG		 - 2.5/3/4
RNG		 - 2
SPE		 - 2.3
#-------------
